<template>
  <section class="review-workspace" aria-label="审查与签发工作区" data-review-workspace>
    <header class="review-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">REVIEW WORKSPACE · S11</span><h3>审查与签发</h3><p>先核对固定版本，再处理意见与缺项。正文只读，修订请返回撰写。</p></div><span class="readonly-badge">已保存版本 · 只读</span></header>
    <div class="review-baseline"><div><span>固定正文版本</span><strong>{{ snapshot.document_revision }}</strong></div><div><span>记录修订</span><strong>{{ snapshot.revision }}</strong></div><div><span>问题 / 证据水位</span><strong>{{ snapshot.issue_watermark }} / {{ snapshot.evidence_watermark }}</strong></div></div>
